# 系统模块图（SD 阶段 · 草案）

```plantuml
@startuml SD
!theme plain

' ===== Layout / Geometry =====
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam nodesep 120
skinparam ranksep 120

' ===== Color Design =====
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #333333
}

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2F4F4F
}

skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333

title Recording System - System Modules (SD)

package "Client Side" {
  [Client / API] as API <<interface>>
}

package "Recording Server" {
  [Recording Service] as RS <<service>>
  [Source Manager] as SM <<manager>>
  [Capture Processing] as CP <<processing>>
  [Subtitle Processing] as SP <<processing>>
  [Output Management] as OM <<output>>
}

package "Infrastructure / OSS" {
  [Pipeline Runtime (GStreamer)] as GST <<infra>>
  [Audio / Video Devices] as DEV <<external>>
  [Network Sources] as NET <<external>>
  [File System] as FS <<external>>
  [ASR / LLM Runtime] as LLM <<external>>
}

' ===== Control Flow =====
API --> RS : control requests

RS --> SM : manage sources
RS --> CP : control capture
RS --> OM : output config

' ===== Source Interaction =====
SM --> DEV : open / close device
SM --> NET : connect / disconnect

' ===== Pipeline Usage =====
CP --> GST : create / control pipelines
OM --> GST : create / control pipelines

GST --> CP : media buffers
GST --> OM : muxed streams

' ===== Subtitle Flow =====
CP --> SP : audio data
SP --> LLM : speech / text processing
SP --> OM : subtitle items

' ===== Output =====
OM -> FS : write output files

@enduml
```
